From 8ae229aaa498ebf4e5dad3ddc97b7d5379c60744 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 12:54:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] feat(exam): mandatory figures/tables via discovery
 catalog, tight figure crops, 100-question exams, question banks up to 1000

- discover-visuals: indexes real figures/tables in selected units (tables transcribed + verified, oversized boxes rejected)
- verify-crops + client pipeline: auto-trim whitespace, AI tight-box refinement, retry on cut, reject incomplete/mismatched
- generate-exam-from-file: figure_id/table_id from catalog, mandatory visual round, mask_cells, diagnostics (why anything was dropped)
- client batching (<=30/batch, parallel, retry, dedupe, top-up, cancel); exams up to 100, banks up to 1000 with incremental save
- BankView: filters, stats, CSV/JSON/print, random exam builder; 'my banks' list; admin sees bank kind
- Settings: exam/bank mode, required figure/table question counts, progress + stop
